  "title": "[FULL] My Ex-Husband Stole My Design... Now I'm Taking Back My Name and My Life! | MY NAME IN LIGHTS",
  "description": "Clara Finch was once a brilliant stage and lighting designer, but a devastating accident three years ago ruined her career. Blamed for the disaster, Clara was forced into the shadows, her reputation destroyed. Now, recently divorced, she discovers a shocking truth: the man selling her masterpiece under his own name at a high-profile charity auction is none other than her manipulative ex-husband, Damon Rook<br><br>Refusing to be silenced and erased any longer, Clara dramatically stops the auction, confronting Damon and reclaiming what is rightfully hers. This bold move catches the attention of Rowan Hale, the powerful venue director who unknowingly signed off on the very documents that falsely ruined Clara three years ago. Seeking to uncover the truth behind the old stage accident, Clara demands an independent review, putting her directly in the crosshairs of Damon, Rowan&apos;s ruthless aunt Vivian, and the corrupt officials who covered up the sabotage.<br><br>As Clara fights tooth and nail to expose the lies, clear her name, and rebuild her career from scratch, she must also navigate a complicated, growing connection with Rowan. But Clara is no longer the woman who compromises. She refuses to let money, powerful families, or even romance dictate her worth. Will Clara successfully expose her ex-husband&apos;s fraud, force the truth into the light, and proudly put her own name back on the marquee? Watch this inspiring and fierce drama about resilience, female empowerment, and sweet revenge to find out!<br><br><br><br>⚠️ Viewer Advisory<br>This video is a fictional contemporary corporate and revenge drama featuring themes of professional sabotage and female empowerment. All characters, storylines, and events depicted are completely fictional. Viewers are advised to enjoy the story responsibly.<br><br>🔥 <b>*Love smart, independent women, toxic exes getting ruined, epic career comebacks, and satisfying karma? Don&apos;t forget to Like, Share, and Subsc